A\"],\"applicableApprovedActorsOnly\":true,\"allDiscoveredActorsReviewedEachCycle\":true,\"actorCountLimit\":null,\"noInventedActorOrPrimitiveFallback\":true,\"noUnapprovedCombatForNoncombatActor\":true,\"preserveExistingDamageTimingHitboxCooldownSpeedSaveProgressionEconomyNetworkAuthority\":true,\"sourceOnlyEvidence\":true,\"runtimeVerified\":false}\nACTOR_MOTION_NEXT_WORK_UNIT: {\"generation\":1,\"actorClass\":\"BOSS\",\"sourceOwnerFile\":\"web-games/ocean-voyage/engine.mjs\",\"qualityAxis\":\"NATIVE_RIG_BINDING\",\"featureId\":\"NATIVE_RIG_BINDING\",\"evidenceCount\":0,\"previousVerifiedScore\":null,\"bodyPlan\":\"UNCONFIRMED\",\"bodyPlanVerifiedFromSource\":false,\"nativeAuthoringApi\":\"RobloxCommonMotion.CreateProceduralActorSequence\",\"proceduralPoseApi\":\"RobloxCommonMotion.SampleProceduralActorMotion\",\"sourceVerifiedMotionVariantPlan\":{\"status\":\"ACTUAL_RIG_BODY_PLAN_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED\",\"variants\":[],\"gameId\":\"ocean-voyage\",\"actorClass\":\"BOSS\",\"featureId\":\"NATIVE_RIG_BINDING\",\"requiresSameActorNativeRuntime\":true,\"noProductionPromotionWithoutQA\":true,\"noGameplayAuthority\":true},\"verifiedTransferGames\":0,\"decision\":\"SOURCE_GROUNDED_UNVERIFIED_EXPLORATION\",\"intent\":\"REAL_NATIVE_ACTOR_ANIMATION_IMPLEMENTATION\",\"noUnknownBoneCreation\":true,\"approvedExistingRigAndClipRequired\":true,\"preserveGameplayAndSave\":true,\"sourceOnlyEvidence\":true,\"runtimeVerified\":false}\nACTOR_MOTION_RULE: 매 게임 제작·모든 빌드업에서 실제 등장하는 플레이어/NPC/몹/동물/보스/동료/탈것 및 움직이는 건축물의 모션을 각각 기존 책임 소스에서 개선한다. 검증된 원본 클립을 우선 재사용하고 적합한 리그/상태/포즈·속도 크로스페이드·발 접지·관성·공격 전조·승인된 타격 이벤트·회복과 피격 반응을 실제 해당 역할에만 적용한다. 미검증 자산, 임의 외형·파츠, 가짜 애니메이션, 승인 없는 밸런스 변경 금지. 동일 버전 실제 게임 배우별 연속프레임·모바일 입력·원격 QA 증거 없으면 UNVERIFIED.\nAUTO_COMPOSITION_RULE: For every present feature, edit its real game owner only. Connect existing lobby/customization/material/inventory/equipment/UI/world/biome/housing/motion/action and source-grounded NPC AI/quest/dialogue/crafting/economy/progression/farming/weather/physics/camera/audio/skill effects/network only when game source and approved design contain them. Biomes must map approved regions to real native terrain/navigation/streaming; housing must preserve placement/cost/ownership/save/rejoin; customization must use actual character model and saved identity; motion must drive existing actions and approved hit events; NPC decisions must not grant economy/save/combat authority; crafting and shopping use actual items/currency/state. Use applicable moduleConnections as source-only QA work units, never completed features. Mobile HUD must use real input/state; no dead controls. Trace acquisition→store→equip→visual/stat→save→reconnect with authoritative state; source signatures never pass QA. No new asset generation or shadow system.\nPLAYER_FACING_INSPECTION_CONTRACT:\ninspectionContract=EVERY_CYCLE; REMOTE_AUTOMATED_F0_F9_AND_INDEPENDENT_QA_ONLY; LOCAL_MANUAL_INSPECTION_NOT_REQUIRED; CHECKLIST_NOT_EXECUTED; QUALITY_UNVERIFIED; inspect all applicable surfaces, expand current details from playerFacingInspectionContract; not-applicable needs design/source reason.\ninspectionIndex=UI_LAYOUT:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|UI_INTERACTION:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|CHARACTER_RENDER:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MONSTER_READABILITY:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE|MOTION_TRANSITIONS:INSPECT_EXISTING_OR_APPROVED_SURFACE\ninspectionRemoteMatrix=UI_LAYOUT:MOBILE_VIEWPORT_SAFE_AREA/TEXT_OVERFLOW_AND_HUD_OCCLUSION/RESIZE_AND_ORIENTATION|UI_INTERACTION:TOUCH_EVENT_TO_ONE_SERVER_OR_UI_ACTION/SCROLL_MODAL_FOCUS/CLOSE_REOPEN_SELECTION|CHARACTER_RENDER:REGISTERED_ASSET_AND_ORIGINAL_HASH/MESH_RIG_ATTACHMENT/MOVEMENT_GROUND_CONTACT|MONSTER_READABILITY:DISTINCT_ENEMY_CREATURE_BOSS_BODY_PLAN_AND_TELEGRAPH/ACTOR_SPECIFIC_ATTACK_HIT_DEATH_STATE_SEQUENCE/DESPAWN_CLEANUP|MOTION_TRANSITIONS:TIME_ORDERED_IDLE_MOVE_TURN_JUMP_PER_ACTOR/ACTOR_SPECIFIC_JOINT_ACTIVITY_POSE_BLEND_FOOT_CONTACT/NPC_CREATURE_BOSS_HIT_DEATH_NO_